Hi,
regarding the first issue, run
table(CTData$Station)
to see which stations have duplicates (unique() won't tell you that).

The error when you specify cameraCol stems from camtrapR being unable to interpret the date/time of your records (but the error message is garbled, it is supposed to show the column name instead of the dates, so the error message is buggy).

More specifically, the error is supposed to arise if there are blank values in the date/time column.
Please check if
any(Data$DateTimeOriginal == "")
and then
Data[Data$DateTimeOriginal == "",]

It is odd though that this should depend on cameraCol. Please also share
str(Data)
to clarify.
Thanks
Jürgen

